{"count":808,"next_page":"https://help.uaudio.com/api/v2/help_center/en-us/articles.json?page=2&per_page=3&sort_by=created_at&sort_order=desc","page":1,"page_count":270,"per_page":3,"previous_page":null,"articles":[{"id":53493261982612,"url":"https://universalaudioinc.zendesk.com/api/v2/help_center/en-us/articles/53493261982612.json","html_url":"https://help.uaudio.com/hc/en-us/articles/53493261982612-Getting-Started-with-LUNA-Play","author_id":1505289635,"comments_disabled":true,"draft":false,"promoted":false,"position":6,"vote_sum":0,"vote_count":0,"section_id":360008484871,"created_at":"2026-09-12T00:11:53Z","updated_at":"2026-09-14T21:15:06Z","name":"Getting Started with LUNA Play","title":"Getting Started with LUNA Play","source_locale":"en-us","locale":"en-us","outdated":false,"outdated_locales":[],"edited_at":"2026-09-14T21:15:06Z","user_segment_id":null,"permission_group_id":345106,"content_tag_ids":[],"label_names":[],"body":"<p>LUNA Play allows you to record vocal or instrument ideas immediately through a simplified interface, without needing to configure a LUNA session first. Quickly capture ideas, shape your tones, and make basic mixes. When you are ready for advanced editing, open your session in the full LUNA timeline or mixer view for more in-depth editing and processing.</p><p>LUNA Play automatically detects your audio input, creates tracks for you, and reduces technical setup so you can focus on making music.</p><h2 id=\"h_01M2GWAH2DTQEKSET38ZN7FCDT\">In this article</h2><ul>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ef91a27d891eb3db4147d75efa3906beb\"><a href=\"#h_01M2A8YCFR71N4ZJYE8DKSH2F0\">Quick Start with LUNA Play</a></li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e1020bbe835efe4de10627f93768a86a1\"><a href=\"#h_01M29CTY7D9YP4DN1VH2CF88AZ\">LUNA Play Interface Overview</a></li>\n</ul><hr><h1 id=\"h_01M2A8YCFR71N4ZJYE8DKSH2F0\">Quick Start with LUNA Play</h1><p>LUNA Play offers four quick start options. On the LUNA Create page, two main options are displayed:</p><ul>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e3aabdcf3266a36f8c788d00f321b054f\">Start Recording in Seconds: Detects your track type and tempo, sets input gain (on compatible hardware with Assistive Auto-Gain), and sets up your track for immediate recording.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e036193038b259c0a9da2d6147ce9993a\">Split Stems and Jam: Drag and drop an audio file to automatically separate it into individual stems (isolated tracks like vocals, drums, and bass). Use this for karaoke workflows, remixing, or playing along with a backing track.</li>\n</ul><p>Click More Ways to Start to access two additional options:</p><ul>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e6dd4082b4bf911d8371898e446762487\">Record Vocals: Creates a vocal track with a tuned channel strip preset loaded for a great-sounding vocal recording.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e80cee23fc5211ff8cd346dfa1f15abc2\">Record Electric Guitar: Creates an electric guitar track equipped with a virtual amplifier and effects.</li>\n</ul><figure class=\"wysiwyg-image wysiwyg-image-resized\" style=\"width: 75%;\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio: 1560/624;\" src=\"https://help.uaudio.com/hc/article_attachments/53499460783508\" alt=\"luna-play-starters.png\" width=\"1560\" height=\"624\"></figure><hr><h1 id=\"h_01M29CTY7D9YP4DN1VH2CF88AZ\">LUNA Play Interface Overview</h1><p>LUNA Play provides a simplified layout that keeps your focus on one track at a time. </p><p>Refer to the image below for a quick overview of the LUNA Play experience.</p><figure class=\"wysiwyg-image\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio: 3088/2254;\" src=\"https://help.uaudio.com/hc/article_attachments/53499430160660\" alt=\"luna-play-callouts.png\" width=\"3088\" height=\"2254\"></figure><h2 id=\"h_01M29CZGMA50Z9MZ0HZW4N62JW\">Tracks</h2><p>Tracks appear in the center of the screen as circular tiles.</p><figure class=\"wysiwyg-image wysiwyg-image-resized\" style=\"width: 75%;\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio: 1364/918;\" src=\"https://help.uaudio.com/hc/article_attachments/53493261979796\" alt=\"play-track-callouts.png\" width=\"1364\" height=\"918\"></figure><p>Hover over any track tile to reveal its controls:</p><ul>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e49ef562817a36666fdd886e1f1c23b5a\">Record enable: Click the upper-left icon to arm the track for recording.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e1dcf71b5317320304f93305fdc8d21d0\">Mute: Click the speaker icon at the bottom-left to silence the track.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e6a9b225c21f1b0353938b7aef05b6136\">Solo: Click the headphone icon at the bottom-right to isolate and listen to only that track.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e00e8dbae7cdf8ad29aa69be36747b23a\">Volume: Click and drag the thick outer ring at the top of the tile to adjust track volume.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e3ab53b4290e598ae1876d84e252d52ea\">Pan (left/right balance): Click and drag near the bottom of the tile to position the audio in the stereo field.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ea92f137b99e4fd1e2cf21738ae4b6b8f\">Track options ( <strong>⋮</strong> ): Click the three vertical dots to access additional settings:<ul>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e1f99d9955b3387cf319c968da98668e6\">Delete track: Removes the track from your session.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ec1e9c7490f0f608a8aa248f45f774f80\">Transcribe Lyrics: Converts vocal recordings into written text (requires a LUNA Studio license).</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ea7ec5eaa002bc90b2568ea8ee517d42e\">Extract Chords: Analyzes and displays chord progressions from an instrument track (requires a LUNA Studio license).</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul><h2 id=\"h_01M2AA5MNTP3VXNS08GQG1D53K\">Track waveform and playback</h2><ul>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e2145872f5cd887a41989b713e3a0df18\">When you select or record a track, the visual representation of the track (waveform) appears in the center of the screen.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e27210b6fb62687e593d527f8ba506940\"> Play / Pause: Press Play to start playback or Pause to stop. The white vertical line (the playhead) indicates your current position in the song. Pausing leaves the playhead in place, so playback resumes from that same spot when you press Play again.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e883de9f16aefd70bc515bfc4b4373ba2\">Record: Begins recording onto any record-enabled tracks.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e85c4929a0e98b0f85bd4cebdce43a201\">Move the playhead: Click anywhere on the waveform to move the playhead to that location.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e1cd863fd4aba7c919605e386bbf6d690\">Looping a selection: Click and drag across a portion of the waveform to highlight it. LUNA Play automatically loops that selected area during playback (turn off Loop in the transport controls to play it once).<br><img class=\"wysiwyg-image-resized\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 1298/644; width: 75%;\" src=\"https://help.uaudio.com/hc/article_attachments/53498046820884\" alt=\"play-selection.png\" width=\"1298\" height=\"644\"> </li>\n</ul><h2 id=\"h_01M29YHVSNQC89MDMB6P38V287\">Main controls and transport</h2><ul>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e5621440b03259d89e149d9dfa7f7c3e2\">Master volume: Adjust the slider in the upper-right corner to control the overall output volume to your headphones or monitor speakers.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e6970641d9258c1e1392a66c159ebd1e9\">View switcher: Toggle between LUNA Play, the main LUNA timeline, and the LUNA mixer using the three icons in the top-left corner.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e926fe49b5c40488802d339e833ed4f8c\">Tempo and Key: LUNA Play automatically detects the tempo from imported tracks or your playing. Click the Tempo area to type a specific BPM (beats per minute) value, or select Detect Song Tempo. To set a musical key signature, click Key, select your key, and click Apply.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"efa3f7f67b21189ea9db07464bcc949aa\">Return to Start: Moves the playhead back to the beginning of your recording.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ea569ddd773dc425903cd4c3f4e5cc9bf\">Speed Control: Click Speed to adjust playback speed from 0.5x (half speed) to 1.5x. Slowing down audio helps with practicing complex sections, while speeding it up makes it easier to navigate long passages.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ee05bae5993019c1b75ee9151a5d219d8\">Loop record/playback: Loop the selected section repeatedly to record or listen back.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ece069b0eae8c3dc66957a192969de042\">Click (metronome): Toggle the click on or off. Right-click to adjust more settings.</li>\n</ul><h2 id=\"h_01M2A0S9YHX98B1S5P11ADHB8H\">Zoom in and out</h2><p>Use the zoom buttons to enlarge or shrink the waveform view. A smaller overview waveform below the main display highlights your current zoomed section.</p><h2 id=\"h_01M2A0XX9GSB7NY3VKG7Q8DP6T\">Track presets and plug-ins</h2><p>LUNA Play automatically presents track presets tailored to your input source. These presets utilize plug-ins from the UAD Explore Free bundle or the LUNA Studio bundle, depending on your license.</p><ul>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e16819079d619fa243ef6dd59f99165bd\">Simple Adjustments: Presets include easy-to-use controls directly inside the LUNA Play interface.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"eabcdad96f0fa7d01c4b6649842f3a0e1\">Bypassing effects: Enable or disable individual plug-ins within a preset by clicking the colored circle next to the plug-in name (for example., Plate Reverb).</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e5e188bda6422dc02bda3a79e190e9716\">Detailed editing: Click any plug-in slider to open its full interface for deeper control. You can also switch to the full LUNA timeline or mixer view at any point for more comprehensive mixing, reordering of plug-ins, and many mmore presets for each plug-in.</li>\n</ul><h2 id=\"h_01M2A7B9G1EZJD0D8ZRGNEZ8EX\">Exporting your mix</h2><p>Click the Export Mix button near the top-right corner to save and download a WAV audio file of your work. For additional export options (such as different file formats or stem exports), switch to the full LUNA timeline or mixer.</p><h2 id=\"h_01M2A8HYA04MJ4W8E98GJV3XK3\">LUNA Play settings</h2><p>LUNA Play prompts you to choose your preferences when you open it for the first time. You can change these options later by clicking the Gear icon:</p><ul>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e9e362c88ac0824ab1914aba0f458a94d\">Use LUNA Play Settings (Recommended): Configures beginner-friendly defaults. Enables <em>Play from Stop Location</em> (playback resumes right where you last paused) and <em>Exclusive Solo</em> (soloing one track automatically clears solo on another track, so you only hear one isolated track at a time).</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e32d0173f50b184011839aee88de710cd\">Keep My Settings: Retains standard LUNA settings, where playback starts from the main playhead marker and multiple tracks can be soloed simultaneously.</li>\n</ul>","user_segment_ids":[]},{"id":53482819335700,"url":"https://universalaudioinc.zendesk.com/api/v2/help_center/en-us/articles/53482819335700.json","html_url":"https://help.uaudio.com/hc/en-us/articles/53482819335700-FAQ-LUNA-3-0","author_id":10206386219156,"comments_disabled":true,"draft":false,"promoted":false,"position":0,"vote_sum":0,"vote_count":0,"section_id":360008331332,"created_at":"2026-09-11T18:33:30Z","updated_at":"2026-09-24T14:21:02Z","name":"FAQ: LUNA 3.0","title":"FAQ: LUNA 3.0","source_locale":"en-us","locale":"en-us","outdated":false,"outdated_locales":[],"edited_at":"2026-09-24T14:21:02Z","user_segment_id":null,"permission_group_id":345086,"content_tag_ids":["01HAQDPT1BF612Y7RSFSV81RJD","01HAT19XBDNYEPPEPQGN1MBKES","01HAZ42SD5YJPV9ZB9CPDW8NCT","01M28VW8CJEWCQ5AJPJ9QMDYWK","01M28VWFZR15FG9F0DR6WQWY80"],"label_names":["LUNA","FAQ","3.0","Studio","LUNA Studio"],"body":"<p><strong>LUNA 3.0</strong> is Universal Audio’s biggest software release to date, bringing effortless idea capture and professional recording workflows into a single creative platform. This release expands LUNA beyond a traditional DAW, making it easier than ever for musicians, producers, engineers, and songwriters to move from inspiration to a finished record without leaving the Universal Audio ecosystem.</p><p>LUNA is built to turn your ideas into release-ready songs. With smart features that keep you in creative control, built-in analog console emulation, and plug-ins trusted by top artists, you'll have all the tools to make a record you’ll love.</p><h3 id=\"h_01M2KA7EHE29ZTSTF42D9AJMB3\">What is LUNA Studio?</h3><p>LUNA Studio is the full version of Universal Audio's DAW for macOS and Windows, with premium UAD plug-ins, instruments, and Extensions built in. It is the new name for LUNA Pro and includes everything that came with it. LUNA Studio is available on its own or as part of the UAD Spark Studio subscription.<br> </p><h3 id=\"h_01M2KACVQWZC5PJ0R99XN8725J\">What is LUNA Free?</h3><p>LUNA Free is the free version of Universal Audio's LUNA DAW for macOS and Windows. It is a full digital audio workstation, with unlimited tracks, a piano roll, smart tools, LUNA Play, Oxide Tape, and a bundle of eight UAD plug-ins. There is no cost, no watermark, and no time limit.<br> </p><h3 id=\"h_01M2KACKWVEBJNR09DPTAKMJZN\">What is the difference between LUNA Free and LUNA Studio?</h3><p>LUNA Free and LUNA Studio are the same DAW, and LUNA Studio adds more smart tools and the professional mixing layer on top. </p><p>LUNA Free gives you unlimited tracks, no watermark, no time limit, the piano roll, LUNA Play, Oxide Tape, eight UAD plug-ins, and 4-track stem separation. </p><p>LUNA Studio adds LUNA Extensions with tape and console emulations from API, Studer, and Ampex, 30 UAD plug-ins and instruments, six ARA plug-ins, hardware inserts, and advanced smart features including Audio to MIDI, 6-Track Stem Separation, Lyric Transcription, and Chord Extraction.</p><h3 id=\"h_01M2K9NFFBZM2HMEQ2D9SMFTQB\">How do I get LUNA Free?</h3><p>To download and install LUNA Free, users must log in to their UA account and sign up to get the <strong>UAD Explore FREE </strong>bundle <a href=\"https://www.uaudio.com/products/uad-explore-free\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>on this page</strong></a>.</p><p>Once the bundle is acquired, LUNA Free can be downloaded in <a href=\"https://www.uaudio.com/products/ua-connect\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>UA Connect</strong></a> on the UAD Explore FREE page.</p><h3 id=\"h_01M2G7H6JHXTSNRXYHKNG2QE0J\">How do I get LUNA Studio?</h3><p>LUNA Studio is included in all <strong>UAD Spark Studio</strong> subscriptions.</p><p>Upgrade pricing is available for existing LUNA Pro customers. The upgrade from LUNA Pro to <a href=\"https://www.uaudio.com/products/luna-studio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>LUNA Studio</strong></a> is currently set to <strong>$79</strong>. To upgrade from LUNA Pro to LUNA Studio, go to the <a href=\"https://www.uaudio.com/products/luna-studio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>LUNA Studio</strong></a> product page and select <strong>Upgrade</strong>, then add it to your cart. Users who previously purchased LUNA Pro <strong>on or after June 1, 2026</strong> can purchase the <strong>Upgrade</strong> for <strong>$2.99</strong>.</p><p>If you are a new user, the <strong>LUNA Studio</strong> full license can be purchased for <strong>$199</strong>.</p><h3 id=\"h_01M2KA5F1SJBVP9W9KGJHQPJXN\">What is the difference between LUNA Studio and UAD Spark Studio?</h3><p>LUNA Studio is the DAW, and UAD Spark Studio is the subscription that includes it. Subscribing to UAD Spark Studio gets you LUNA Studio along with the full UAD native plug-in and instrument library. If the DAW is all you want, LUNA Free costs nothing, and LUNA Studio can be bought on its own.</p><h3 id=\"h_01M2V2B7RS1KGT2PW8RX5SB46P\">I already own LUNA Pro. What does the LUNA Studio release mean for me?</h3><p>There's only one LUNA app, and as a LUNA Pro owner, you get the latest version. Your LUNA Pro plug-ins and extensions stay intact, and your free update to LUNA 3.0 adds tons of new features on top of it. You're not locked into an old version. You'll receive every future update with free features and bug fixes.</p><h4 id=\"h_01M2V2BH3HD9F8VHJ0T6NV0RDC\">New free features:</h4><ul>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ecd4c4bc23fde86426d8bacf723eaf0e0\">LUNA Play</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e898068f45fe8db0c327c7de4a4cd51e5\">4-Track Stem Separation</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ee4fc738d39b05d70e605fb50d99c082c\">Folder Tracks</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e6795b34dd1673edf47a23f5cbba97b36\">Piano Roll</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e7d101cddc24d542981cd467faa198225\">Adaptive Grid</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"eb3358348e453e52e64e9c083cbcdf596\">Mono Inputs for Stereo Tracks</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e05cdd2e916854831979c97d6417f44e5\">Strip Silence</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e646990d9445704b94cce76fb4c96ecaa\">Clip Gain Automation</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e1940df81a44ccf78cd2eb4d97404a9ad\">Record FX</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e81255c1d4bfbcc443cdd77cb22d32cac\">Click Track Automation and Export</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e5ba365db5671f10b6f2e587ebc1442a3\">Chord, Key, and Time Signature Rulers</li>\n</ul><p>LUNA Studio is a paid upgrade that unlocks an additional feature set within LUNA, adding new smart features, UAD Topline Vocal Tune, and additional ARA plug-ins. As a LUNA Pro customer, you're eligible for a special upgrade price on LUNA Studio.</p><h4 id=\"h_01M2V2BRAX7SEC55K2RAS1DG8X\">LUNA Studio exclusive features:</h4><ul>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"edc5b35268301e945ec2e7efd09344a1a\">Audio-to-MIDI</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e0e0edb02e99424a8b1604e2a41cf5355\">6-Track Stem Separation</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e5481469e67806acc1183f1e72733b4a1\">Lyric Transcription, Powered by Moises</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ee7d692618f7198e3a7bf4b3f29d8b6cb\">Chord Extraction, Powered by Moises</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e9becfa79ccb39a4bcd0e8c0ce3e2b3aa\">Plug-Ins<ul>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"eb6e1baab4d0eb63adf62188f4eee4395\">UAD Topline Vocal Tune</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e6304f94843a8b19434c6557bcb37df62\">Celemony Tonalic essential</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"eaac028e92557affc08f8996f9c5d9fdd\">Dreamtronics Synthesizer V Studio 2 Core</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul><h3 id=\"h_01M2K9SJQEFGHDDXD24A4ZWQD5\">What new features are included in LUNA Free 3.0?</h3><p>The features listed below are all included in the LUNA Free 3.0 update:</p><h4 id=\"h_01M2G7H6P9PBXF741RG9BZ1648\">LUNA Play</h4><p>Capture ideas the moment inspiration strikes.</p><p>LUNA Play allows musicians to immediately record vocal or instrument ideas without first creating a DAW session. Users can organize ideas, and continue production later inside the full LUNA timeline.</p><p>LUNA Play automatically detects incoming audio, creates tracks automatically, and removes manual session setup so users can focus entirely on creating.</p><h4 id=\"h_01M2G7H6PHZDACCAMQCZ61AR1H\">Mono In → Stereo Out</h4><p>Use mono recording sources with stereo processing.</p><p>Assign a mono microphone or instrument input directly to a stereo track, allowing immediate access to stereo plug-ins such as Topline Vocal Suite or Paradise Guitar.</p><p>This enables mono recordings to take advantage of stereo effects without requiring additional routing or track management.</p><h4 id=\"h_01M2G7H6Q0JC4ZGRG6FSSX9ZNH\">Strip Silence</h4><p>Automatically detects audible regions in an audio recording and removes silent sections, turning long recordings into clean, editable clips in seconds. With adjustable threshold, minimum clip duration, and clip padding controls, users can quickly clean up vocals, dialogue, drums, and instrument recordings while preserving natural transients and maintaining a completely non-destructive workflow.</p><h4 id=\"h_01M2G7H6Q3T31F3RRT657B8VRT\">Clip Gain Automation</h4><p>Perform detailed gain adjustments directly on audio clips before plug-ins and fader automation.</p><p>Clip Gain Automation enables users to draw gain curves across individual words, phrases, or regions, making vocal balancing and level correction faster while preserving downstream processing.</p><p>Because clip gain occurs before inserts, users can drive compressors, tape, and console emulations more consistently.</p><h4 id=\"h_01M2G7H6Q9QKA6BG6P3BFABVEY\">Record FX</h4><p>Print effects while recording.</p><p>Record FX gives native users the same recording workflow previously exclusive to Apollo interfaces.</p><p>Users can insert Universal Audio plug-ins, including guitar amps such as Dream, into a dedicated Record FX slot and record directly to the timeline with processing already applied.</p><p>Record FX processing occurs before Tape and Console emulation, allowing tracks to receive subtle tonal shaping during recording and reducing the amount of processing required during mixing.</p><h4 id=\"h_01M2G7H6QBB016MZ6QV9F0ZHGV\">Click Track Automation &amp; Export</h4><p>Gain complete control over the session click.</p><p>Users can automate click volume alongside tempo changes, mute the click during sensitive recording sections to reduce headphone bleed, and increase click levels where stronger performance cues are needed. The click track can also be exported during Mixdown alongside other session outputs.</p><h4 id=\"h_01M2G7H6QFTX0Y50HAAA6HBA7Z\">Stem Separation</h4><p>Separate stereo mixes into editable stems.</p><p>LUNA Free includes:</p><ul>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e0dacad6a5e72f240144c41396860d757\">4-track Stem Separation</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e9f61c3432c072da7d500744d116c1f9d\">Acapella creation</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e4da43d81201f1bd06f8c5206667613d5\">Instrumental creation</li>\n</ul><p>Users can experience our new source separation and upgrade to <strong>LUNA Studio</strong> to unlock additional instrument isolation.</p><h4 id=\"h_01M2G7H6QN85BBB26RR4Z1GACV\">Piano Roll</h4><p>Edit MIDI with greater precision with Luna’s new adaptive grid. The Piano Roll provides a dedicated workspace for editing MIDI notes while preserving visibility of the primary timeline.</p><p>Users can:</p><ul>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e8020e6c9a6ef2026e428d24e124d6a6b\">Paint and edit MIDI notes</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e5d33949a3c7371765a2eb7c4134cb7c0\">Highlight scales for scale aware editing</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e0958eeed8b96c85bed7422b3fdaead1c\">Maintain context within the arrangement</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e8f68f6835da6c4d97f1697b1dac26e9b\">The result is a faster editing workflow with fewer interruptions.</li>\n</ul><h3 id=\"h_01M2G7H6QT67KZ4AEM37P0KWKK\">What does LUNA Studio include?</h3><p>LUNA Studio expands beyond recording and mixing by introducing new creative tools for producers, songwriters, composers, and engineers. These capabilities help users extend existing musical ideas, generate new creative content, and finish productions without leaving the LUNA timeline.</p><p>Upgrade pricing is available for existing LUNA Pro customers. <a href=\"https://www.uaudio.com/products/luna-studio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>LUNA Studio</strong></a> is also included in <a href=\"https://www.uaudio.com/products/uad-spark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>UAD Spark Studio</strong></a> subscriptions.</p><h4 id=\"h_01M2G7H6QX0RWD6DG7F4QEJKEP\">Audio-to-MIDI</h4><p>Transform audio performances into editable MIDI.</p><p>Users can:</p><ul>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e1f46b49ee10d559f9dc37d8fc69a7a40\">Convert performances into MIDI</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"eca71f443182cc16025e6db93120771b5\">Layer virtual instruments with recorded audio</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e9f3de1837bce895e7f72fa0b0b519e94\">Replace recorded instruments with software instruments or external synthesizers</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ed47360f3129a6586a7012ecef1461be4\">Quantize timing</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e5aabac8fce8ef764a2aa07909ef29b41\">Apply swing</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e8bf6dd170711fb5134ba91c2706f83f1\">Edit musical performances with complete MIDI flexibility</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e76938002b4ab9e8acad4c9539a8d32a5\">Convert separated stems into editable MIDI for greater creative control</li>\n</ul><h4 id=\"h_01M2G7H6R6JP3B7ZGMZ2PT87ZJ\">6-Track Stem Separation</h4><p>Unlock more detailed source separation than LUNA Free.</p><p>LUNA Studio separates stereo recordings into:</p><ul>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ee8e3b8c68c25b9bc9c32026cb95aaa40\">Vocals</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e1bbdd8f9470ddadd2fc97b03fe7e6f09\">Drums</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ec96798d1c569c2fcaccba0d5289068dd\">Bass</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"eab611b434dac9f1f8d0820ca89205495\">Piano</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e0d14e183b784a89beaaac38432d321a6\">Guitar</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e3a29df9b927bcf0aceeb453e6a00a9f9\">Other instruments</li>\n</ul><p>This additional separation gives producers finer control when replacing performances, remixing songs, creating backing tracks, or adding new production layers.</p><h4 id=\"h_01M2G7H6RDXTG88VR0TGV5518T\">Lyric Transcription, powered by Moises</h4><p>Automatically transcribe vocals into a time-aligned lyric browser.</p><p>Lyrics remain synchronized with the project timeline, allowing users to:</p><ul>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e737551fcb879d6cf79f87640731c54cf\">Jump directly to specific lyrics</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"eb534318d02af10ead9cf51d5f941ef51\">Navigate vocal performances quickly</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e58968b652c875fb0b7fc63b57ee67026\">Find punch-in locations</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ea27e10bbb30a4f861c9f87d31fc5c6d1\">Perform vocal corrections more efficiently</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e9f326f8d8ef13cefb23f5a11ec441646\">Organize production around lyrical content</li>\n</ul><h4 id=\"h_01M2G7H6RQ2BPHQ5QX3WVYS95K\">Chord Extraction, powered by Moises</h4><p>Automatically detect and map harmonic content throughout a song.</p><p>Chord Extraction analyzes recordings, identifies the performed chords, and aligns them with the project timeline.</p><p>Users can:</p><ul>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ef5d0d88298b1b312e25fcc17fe7996f3\">Learn songs through harmonic analysis</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e41f6c74088113bab34d6d08a5d1299cb\">Display chord guides during recording sessions</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e106898d123c3e164a6c99a1debf4e1d7\">Copy and paste chord labels</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e553ee0142c7cc49ba8e9d28ef5c168e3\">Reuse harmonic information throughout an arrangement</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ea6375ef50aa661cf48bf4960a6421b03\">Give performers visual chord references during tracking</li>\n</ul><p>By making sessions harmonically aware, LUNA becomes a more powerful songwriting and collaboration environment.</p><h4 id=\"h_01M2G7H6RXV72F3TKC238Y4VSJ\">New ARA Software</h4><ul>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e240e62cb830d55d585a8c0ec168cde87\">\n<strong>Celemony Tonalic essential</strong>: Get access to real acoustic and electric guitar performances for songwriting, sketches, and quick arrangements, played to your chords, tempo, and groove, right inside the LUNA timeline. </li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e2bd762c6551a906502783eacf5f59f87\">\n<strong>Synthesizer V Studio 2 Core</strong>: Synthesizer V brings vocal performance directly into the production workflow. Users can create, edit, and refine vocal performances inside LUNA using ARA integration, allowing producers and engineers to complete vocal arrangements and finalize productions without switching applications.</li>\n</ul>","user_segment_ids":[]},{"id":53452669509268,"url":"https://universalaudioinc.zendesk.com/api/v2/help_center/en-us/articles/53452669509268.json","html_url":"https://help.uaudio.com/hc/en-us/articles/53452669509268-Transcribing-Lyrics","author_id":1505289635,"comments_disabled":true,"draft":false,"promoted":false,"position":17,"vote_sum":0,"vote_count":0,"section_id":360008484871,"created_at":"2026-09-10T21:08:55Z","updated_at":"2026-09-14T17:00:33Z","name":"Transcribing Lyrics","title":"Transcribing Lyrics","source_locale":"en-us","locale":"en-us","outdated":false,"outdated_locales":[],"edited_at":"2026-09-10T21:21:03Z","user_segment_id":null,"permission_group_id":345106,"content_tag_ids":["01M26JCC1K5CQE76842D5RRDJ9","01M26JDGHZBM5S4XWSEY8NJQ1B"],"label_names":["lyrics"],"body":"<p>With LUNA Studio you can automatically extract lyrics from your vocal tracks. You can then edit the lyrics, see the lyrics aligned with the audio  in the timeline, navigate by clicking words in the lyrics, and open a dynamic lyrics browser sidebar.</p><h2 id=\"h_01M26JZ5QJ85VTRSJK75KFYCE3\">In this article</h2><ul>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"eebff0f0ecd83a5c450d1c375d2f69867\"><a href=\"#h_01M26JE5DG5MKZMRRGZ8XVBQ34\">Prerequisites to Transcribe Lyrics</a></li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ee6df2a24c1e623c3db1367865d45c24a\"><a href=\"#h_01M26JEPS4HZEK0Z32SZWD23EY\">Transcribing Lyrics</a></li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ea11c4a7df74f26e4433209c0e255948c\"><a href=\"#h_01M26JFFD27R4EXDWH6R815ZQY\">Working with Lyrics</a></li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e7b1b294dafe03784554dc33af81588b6\"><a href=\"#h_01M26JGBA1QRWZ7E8WCN3Y8YQX\">Using the Lyrics Browser</a></li>\n</ul><h1 id=\"h_01M26JE5DG5MKZMRRGZ8XVBQ34\">Prerequisites to Transcribe Lyrics</h1><ul>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ec71402974f5659ee2372bcf1a026a735\">Lyric transcription requires a LUNA Studio license.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e505f2956fb34c1390c5d57cc42d5ac0b\">To transcribe lyrics, your track must be detected or set as a Vocal track. If Instrument Detection is enabled, this typically happens automatically. If the track is not designated as a Vocal track, you can manually set the track type in the timeline track header. </li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e6bf518e98062697a6c3d3a234f0eb838\">Lyric transcription works best when vocal clips do not overlap. Consolidate clips on the vocal track for the most accuracy. </li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ed43f98faf24f8935ed0deca3fd129d00\">Lyrics are transcribed in the cloud, so your computer must be connected to the internet.</li>\n</ul><h1 id=\"h_01M26JEPS4HZEK0Z32SZWD23EY\">Transcribing Lyrics</h1><ol>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e1154b8d06006bd6752a950eb4ee87fbe\">Right-click on a clip or multiple clips, or right-click in the track settings area for a Vocal track.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e56d0b3c8091b5b8a74c6e08b7a23b6af\">Choose Transcribe Lyrics. The Lyric Transcription dialog appears briefly.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e3673a38dd58fb6cf489ab63cc543d935\">To show lyric transcription progress, click Show Progress. Otherwise, the lyric transciption completes in the background.</li>\n</ol><p>When lyric transcription completes, a dialog informs you that the lyrics are ready. To view the lyrics in the Lyrics Browser, click Open Lyrics Browser.</p><h1 id=\"h_01M26JFFD27R4EXDWH6R815ZQY\">Working with Lyrics</h1><p>Lyrics appear in a strip beneath your vocal track. </p><ul>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e06fae9a3993568632c6c57863f1de180\">As you play your session, the current word is underlined. </li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ed8005fdfeb954e0726a37be8485a1a09\">Click a word to jump to that position in the timeline. </li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e03124fdbe7069becdbec133bb454b1ec\">Double-click a word to edit it. </li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e8abdd1b5acd728ecbd749759e44601fb\">As you zoom in and out in your LUNA session, lyrics are expanded and contracted. </li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e056e29ac539a079abb2d018e2420de1e\">To see all of the lyrics for a track, click the icon at the right edge of the Lyrics track to open the Lyrics browser.</li>\n</ul><figure class=\"wysiwyg-image wysiwyg-image-resized\" style=\"width: 75%;\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio: 948/338;\" src=\"https://help.uaudio.com/hc/article_attachments/53452955904660\" alt=\"toggle-lyric-browser.png\" width=\"948\" height=\"338\"></figure><h1 id=\"h_01M26JGBA1QRWZ7E8WCN3Y8YQX\">Using the Lyrics Browser</h1><p>The lyrics browser shows all lyrics and markers for the track.</p><ul>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ee40ced8e2ad92d9a649ce89d14367806\">Lyrics are arranged in the browser under any existing markers.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"eeb89370b168228ecfddd25c92c3ceca4\">As you play your session, the current word is underlined in the browser. </li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e5dcda3a4fd32aa391b16f16af5ca8c2b\">The current timeline selection is highlighted in the browser.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ec6b980e4225699ddd25dcf3ea05b9946\">Click a word or marker to jump to that position in the timeline. </li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ef8aee8dce3a6aac4231df01b0f155e1b\">Double-click a word to edit it.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ed0e2724b87103c337f838fd5a0a3833c\">To search for a word, begin typing in the search bar. Results are filtered as you type. </li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e801ab0f59a1aeddefd5801286bb38dfb\">Close the Lyrics browser by clicking the X at the top right.</li>\n</ul><figure class=\"wysiwyg-image wysiwyg-image-resized\" style=\"width: 75%;\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio: 880/760;\" src=\"https://help.uaudio.com/hc/article_attachments/53452941128596\" alt=\"lyrics-callouts.png\" width=\"880\" height=\"760\"></figure><p><span class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-small\">v260910</span></p>","user_segment_ids":[]}],"sort_by":"created_at","sort_order":"desc"}